{"text": "DAILY BULLETIN. ..DAILY BULLETIN. ..DAILY BULLETIN...\nPUBLIC AFFAIRS DIVISION...THE TOBACCO INSTITUTE.\n\nFriday\nNovember 11, 1994\n\n+ ++IN REVIEW. ..IN REVIEW...IN REVIEW...\n\nWYOMING Governor Sullivan\u2019s Health Care Commission announced\nrecommendations for financing...Commission proposed increasing\ncigarette excise tax by 14 cents per pack...also increases in taxes.\non beer, wine and distilled spirits...covernor-elect Geringer has\nsaid he will review Commission\u2019s reconmendations.\n\nHealth Board in HOLMES COUNTY OH heard introduction last month of\ncomprehensive snoking ban with no exemptions. ROWAN COUNTY NC\nBoard of Health heard comments on 11/9 on possible ventilation\nrequirements. ..ordinance adopted last year required designated\nsmoking areas to have \"adequate ventilation,\" which remains to be\ndefined.\n\nMONTICELLO MN City Council has scheduled 11/14 final vote for\namendments to self-service display ban...amendnents would require\ndisplays to be supervised...would also require all employees take\ntraining class on sale of tobacco products to minors.\n\nUs CONGRESS returns for lame duck session on GATT at the end of\nthis month...Senate Republicans and Democrats will hold party\ncaucuses to select leadership on 12/2...House Democratic caucus\nwill begin three days of meetings 11/30...House GOP will organize\n12/5-7.\n\nFor further information...call Public affairs,\n\nTI1683-0625", "words": [{"text": "DAILY", "x0": 176, "y0": 172, "x1": 216, "y1": 180, "conf": 90.0}, {"text": "BULLETIN.", "x0": 225, "y0": 172, "x1": 294, "y1": 180, "conf": 64.0}, {"text": "..DAILY", "x0": 307, "y0": 172, "x1": 353, "y1": 180, "conf": 64.0}, {"text": "BULLETIN.", "x0": 361, "y0": 172, "x1": 416, "y1": 180, "conf": 0.0}, {"text": "..DAILY", "x0": 444, "y0": 172, "x1": 490, "y1": 181, "conf": 0.0}, {"text": "BULLETIN...", "x0": 498, "y0": 172, "x1": 585, "y1": 181, "conf": 92.0}, {"text": "PUBLIC", "x0": 180, "y0": 185, "x1": 228, "y1": 194, "co